### 正确请求
POST http://localhost:1236/api/user/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "student01",
  "password": "123456"
}

### 错误请求
POST http://localhost:1236/api/user/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "student01",
  "password": "654321"
}

